{"id":"C90d297b7a8cf4fdc4672","zh":"域估计","en":"region estimation","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"估计动力响应指标所属状态区域的方法。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于高速铁路车辆系统动力响应的状态分级，根据轨道不平顺控制指标，判断动力响应指标所处的等级区域。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C90d297b7a8cf4fdc4672","zh":"域估计","en":"region estimation","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"Hf5f9eebf4ae9454ef0bc","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 徐磊等（2016）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D4555f3ca927501ee0f83","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"域估计"},{"id":"De6d1df42a96e85e45e2f","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"region estimation"}],"sources":{"P107":{"id":"P107","title":"高速铁路车辆系统动力响应指标域估计及线路状态反演方法","authors":"徐磊,高建敏,翟婉明","year":"2016","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2016.05.013","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-region-estimation-of-dynamic-response-indexes-for-high-speed-railway-vehicle-system-and-line-status"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S967fcfeee8ba64fa9673","source_id":"P107","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"The simulation results showed that the accuracy rate of region estimation for the dynamic response indexes was above 80%, while the identification accuracy for line structural damage condition of fastener disengaging was above 70%.","citations":[{"source_id":"P107","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S7358a7d45ebe90b96035","source_id":"P107","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"根据单一变量法原理,将车辆-轨道系统激励源划分为轨道不平顺及其它综合因素(如温度荷载、材料损伤等),依据动力响应指标域估计模型提出了一个简单的线路基础状态反演方法。","citations":[{"source_id":"P107","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Seb07326028b2eb28ff56","source_id":"P107","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"基于动力学仿真模型,将轨道不平顺作用下的车辆系统动力响应指标分为整修、恶化、保养3个区域,计算、统计学习轨道不平顺指标与车辆系统部件动力响应指标域之间的关联关系,建立并获得车辆系统动力响应指标域估计模型及不同动力响应指标的域界线。","citations":[{"source_id":"P107","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C8e1ec5c85f73deef336f","target_concept_id":"C8e1ec5c85f73deef336f","target_z